<p>The tasks table schema defines the structure for storing tasks. It includes:</p>
<ul>
<li>A unique, auto-incrementing integer <code>id</code>.</li>
<li><code>title</code> and <code>description</code> fields.</li>
<li>A <code>completed</code> status.</li>
<li><code>createdAt</code> and <code>updatedAt</code> timestamps to track creation and modification times.</li>
</ul>
<p>For type safety when interacting with tasks (e.g., selecting or inserting), <code>Task</code> and <code>NewTask</code> types are exported. These types are inferred from the schema and can be used throughout the application.</p>
